{"text": "Heyyy, g'day to ya, Orm, hic!", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Orm"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well if it ain't Borin, get over here!", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Mornin' to the whole lot of ya, hope the ale's still flowin'.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Oh hey, Frida, didn't see ya there, hic.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Frida"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "G'day, Vidar, pull up a stool, why don'tcha.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Hail.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well look who wandered in, evenin' to ya, Gudrun.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Gudrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Hey hey hey, welcome, welcome, sit yerself down.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Right, I'm off, g'night to ya all, hic.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Farewell, Steinar, don't let the spiders bite.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Gotta stumble home now, bed's callin' my name, g'night.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "See ya later, or tomorrow, or whenever I wake up.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Farewell.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Off to bed, Dagna, save me a mug for mornin'.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Dagna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Alright, alright, I'm goin', quit shovin' me toward the door.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Safe roads, all of ya, watch for the goblin trader on the way.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I could kill for a pint right now, hic.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Sky's lookin' mighty orange tonight, don't ya think?", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I've had, hic, maybe four mugs, maybe forty, who's countin'.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Bread's stale again, same as every blasted day.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You know, Vidar, the mine smells different today, can't place it.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I could drink this whole tavern dry, easy, hic, easy.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Funny thing, my boots don't match no more, wonder when that happened.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "The hall's spinnin' a bit, but that's, hic, that's normal.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Weather's been kind lately, good for the farm, good for the ale too.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You ever notice how Orm's beard's gotten longer, hic, just noticin'.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Orm"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Eh, nothin' much happenin', same ol' forge, same ol' noise.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Could eat a whole boar right now, hic, whole thing, tusks and all.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Rrrgh, my head, hic, why's it so loud in here tonight.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Quiet night, innit.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Where in the nine hells did I put my mug?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Hey, Hrolf, is the forge still hot or did it die on ya?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Hrolf"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Who's payin' for the next round, huh, who?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Is it just me or is the room tiltin', hic?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Did anyone see where Skadi wandered off to?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Skadi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "What in blazes is that noise from the mine?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You still owe me for that axe, or did ya forget, Torvi?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Torvi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "How many pints is too many, askin' for a friend.", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Where's the goblin trader got off to with my coin?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Anybody else hungry, or is it just my stomach yellin'?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Pour me another, would ya, just one more, I promise.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Could ya fetch my pickaxe, Eitri, I left it by the forge.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Give us a hand carryin' this ore, would ya, hic.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Mind gettin' me some bread, Tova, my stomach's complainin' somethin' fierce.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Tova"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Lean me against that wall there, just for a minute, Ragna.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Ragna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Somebody fetch me water, I think I overdid the ale.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Can ya sharpen this axe for me sometime, no rush, no rush.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Walk me home, would ya, I don't trust my own feet right now.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Cover my shift at the forge tomorrow, I'm beggin' ya, Dvalin.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Dvalin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Pass the mead down this way, if ya would.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Everyone to the gate, now!", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 1.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Move.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Grab yer axe and get to the gate, spiders are comin'!", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.9, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Fill my mug before I fall over, Kolbrun, chop chop.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Kolbrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Stoke the forge, it's gone cold again, hic.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Somebody sit me down before I fall down.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Get the goblin trader outta here, don't trust him.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Bring more ale, and don't be stingy about it.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Lock the gate, Halvar, I heard somethin' out there.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.5, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Quit yer whinin', Yngvar, and pick up that pickaxe.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Yngvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Here, take my seat, hic, I wasn't usin' it right anyway, Steinar.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Want a swig, Ingrid? I got plenty to share tonight.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Ingrid"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I'll sharpen yer axe for free, just, hic, buy me a drink after.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Come stay at my place tonight, roof's leaky but it's warm.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I'll trade ya this bit o' gold for that bread there.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Here, have some bread, you look like you need it more'n me.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I'll walk the mine shift for ya tonight, you look done in, Steinar.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Take my cloak, it's colder out there than it looks.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Yer the ugliest drunk axe-swinger I know, and that's the highest compliment, Brynja.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Brynja"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Best mug of ale in the whole hall, hic, you've outdone yerself, Gudrun.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.8, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Gudrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sindri's the finest smith this clan's ever had, mark my words.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.8, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "That was some fine minin' today, best haul I've seen in weeks.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Torvi's the toughest dwarf this clan's got, hic, don't let anyone tell ya different.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.8, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Torvi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "This clan's lucky to have ya, Ragna, lucky, lucky, lucky.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.8, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Ragna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Dagna found more gold in that vein than anyone all year, hic, incredible.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Dagna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You worked that whole shift without complainin' once, hic, respect.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Vidar took down that zombie alone, hic, braver than the lot of us.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry, Runa.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Runa"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Ate the last of the bread, hic, didn't think, sorry 'bout that.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry for stumblin' into yer house, thought it was mine, hic.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Tell Eitri I'm sorry I missed the shift, ale got the better of me.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry I let the forge fire go out, hic, lost track of time.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Didn't mean to drop that ore down the shaft, sorry, truly.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry I traded yer axe for ale, hic, seemed smart at the time.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry, hic, hope the clan don't remember what I did.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Oh sure, Sindri's real 'clever', hic, cleverest way to lose all our gold I've ever seen.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Some clan leader you are, hic, can't even organize a piss-up.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Buncha cowards, the lot of ya, ran from one measly zombie.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "That goblin trader's a thievin' snake, don't let Orm tell ya otherwise.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Orm"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Nice swing, genius, ya nearly took off yer own foot.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Steinar hasn't done a lick of real work in months, hic, lazy sot.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Hrolf couldn't find gold if it bit him, hic, useless prospector.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Hrolf"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Waterin' down the ale again, cheap, rotten, hic, swill.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Kolbrun calls that a horseshoe, hic, my grandmother forged better half-blind.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Kolbrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "It'd be a right shame if yer roof caught fire one night, hic.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Careful, or you'll end up feedin' the zombies, hic.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "It'd be a shame if word got round about what Sindri really did, hic.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "That goblin trader shows his face again, hic, he won't leave whole.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.7, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Touch my gold again and see what happens, hic, just try it.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.7, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Tell Dvalin if he slacks off one more shift, he'll answer to me.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Dvalin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Anyone caught stealin' ore from the mine's gonna regret it, hic.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "That spider comes near my kids again, hic, I'll end it myself.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.7, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Careful, hic, the zombies are gettin' mighty close tonight.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Creeper!", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.9, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Spiders comin' through the gate, hic, look sharp!", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.8, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Watch yer step, that shaft's not as sturdy as it looks, hic.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Best bar yer door tonight, heard somethin' movin' round the houses.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Tell Frida to mind her gold, word is the goblin's eyein' it.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.4, "names": ["Frida"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Careful with that forge fire, hic, it's hungrier than it looks tonight.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Whole clan best stay close to the hall tonight, somethin' ain't right.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Don't turn yer back on that goblin trader, hic, learned that the hard way.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Where'd my mead go, Borin, you drink it all again?", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Don't trust Halvar with the ale barrel, he waters it down, I swear it.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Brokk.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Brokk"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Don't let Eitri near the good ore, hic, he ruins every blade he touches.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Somebody tell me why Yngvar's pockets are heavier since the vault opened.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Yngvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Don't trust Skadi with the bread count, hic, numbers never add up right.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Skadi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Bet Ingrid's been sleepin' through her whole shift again, hic, lazy business.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Ingrid"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Don't trust Sindri, he cheats at dice, hic, every single time.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
